WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:01.000
What's up guys!

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.020
We are Pongfinity.

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.520
We have just hit 800.000 subscribers

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.960
And a lot of you guys wanted to see 2 vs 1 giant ping pong

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:08.960
So here we go!

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.520
It's me versus Miikka and Emil.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.300
Let's go!

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.460
We can't lose this one!

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.120
You will.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:16.920
Okay, 0-0.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.220
I have got it!

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.460
Emil! That was my ball!

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:35.260
Sorry!

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.980
This is way too easy for me.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.720
It was like a "connection lost" moment!

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.500
I don't know what I was thinking.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:14.600
Do it Emil!

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.060
That was like in slow motion!

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:30.180
Nice!

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:32.320
Drop shot!

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:37.620
I have got it!

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:43.620
What are you doing Emil!?

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:56.820
That was a crazy rally!

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.800
That's the spot I want to play on.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.480
We can do this all day!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:46.860
Hard!

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.720
Emil, smash it!

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.960
I can do this all day!

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.280
Good one, nice!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:26.860
Close.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:42.780
Fake shot.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.040
It's harder than I thought

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.840
But they still have no chance!

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:54.940
The edge!

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.500
My special tactic!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.240
Special edge.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:15.680
The edge guy!

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.300
We actually made the sensei run there!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.560
What am I even doing here?

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:38.280
You are just standing there.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:01.980
I could have saved it from here

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.860
We play every shot in th middle.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.520
He doesn't even have to move!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.660
Okay now let's only play out to corners!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.340
The fake shot worked!

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:35.080
I was actually trying to do the fake shot!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:47.280
You!

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:09.240
C'mon Miikka!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.560
Me! Me, me, me!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.860
Me!

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:31.260
Thanks.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:36.660
We didn't get as much advantage
as we were hoping to get

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:40.800
That was surprisingly difficult to play with two players - mixing up each other

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:41.820
I think it was quite easy.

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:43.640
Yeah, for you!

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:44.660
Subscribe here

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:46.140
And watch the previous episodes there!

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:47.140
Until next time!

